Subject: [PATCH 15/21] fix(notifications): i18n key nested error + ScoreRing
 overflow + Notifications UI overhaul

- fix(i18n): notification.* keys were misplaced under common.* in zh-CN.json / en-US.json, causing raw key strings to display in production
- fix(ScoreRing): score/label/star overflow when size=100; auto-hide stars below 140px
- feat(Notifications): add stat cards (total/unread/urgent), batch select/delete, view-mode toggle (list/compact), per-type left color bar, hover/selected states
- feat(notificationStore): expand mock data from 6 to 10 entries, force-override stale localStorage via persist v2 migration
- style: improved type icon mapping (urgent -> FireOutlined), responsive stat-card grid
